    "Each \"props\" object has all 37 tree_props fields, named and ordered exactly as the C++ struct in tree_system.cpp (and TREE_PROP_NAMES in tests.js), so it can be assigned straight onto the tree props object: for (k in props) tree[k] = props[k]; tree.needs_update = true.",
